WEBVTT

00:00:09.860 --> 00:00:12.030
I'm in love with you, Kuzuha.

00:00:13.210 --> 00:00:15.870
I'm sorry. I think I'm...

00:00:17.330 --> 00:00:19.520
What am I doing?

00:00:33.110 --> 00:00:41.420
I, My, Me! - Strawberry-eggs

00:00:33.110 --> 00:00:39.510
A blue sky before the end of the rainy season

00:00:33.110 --> 00:00:39.510
Tsuyu ake mae no aozora wa...

00:00:39.920 --> 00:00:47.430
makes a heart dance with expectation

00:00:39.920 --> 00:00:47.430
hitoashi hayaku kokoro wo odoraseru

00:00:48.850 --> 00:00:54.910
Summer is coming yet again

00:00:48.850 --> 00:00:54.910
Kotoshi mo mosugu natsuga kuru

00:00:55.900 --> 00:01:03.340
The city and people are coming to life bursting with joy

00:00:55.900 --> 00:01:03.340
Machi mo hito mo ukare kibun de zawameki dasu

00:01:04.910 --> 00:01:12.460
A man who's grown up without losing his boyish heart

00:01:04.910 --> 00:01:12.460
Shonen no kokoro no mama otona ni natta hito

00:01:12.960 --> 00:01:21.190
We can't go back to the day we met for the first time, but...

00:01:12.960 --> 00:01:21.190
Futari deatta anohi ni modorenai kedo...

00:01:23.330 --> 00:01:30.930
If I close my eyes, I can see your smiling face

00:01:23.330 --> 00:01:30.930
Hitomi wo tojireba hohoemu kao ga mieru

00:01:31.140 --> 00:01:38.840
The song we both loved. Do you still sing it?

00:01:31.140 --> 00:01:38.840
Daisuki na ano uta. Ima mo utatte masuka?

00:01:38.840 --> 00:01:46.680
I can still hear that gentle voice and melody

00:01:38.840 --> 00:01:46.680
Watashi ni wa kikoeru. Yasashii koe to melody

00:01:46.680 --> 00:01:55.960
During times of sadness, I will remember you

00:01:46.680 --> 00:01:55.960
Yowaki na toki hodo anata wo omoidasu

00:01:58.140 --> 00:02:04.230
11th Period
Fragrance Heart to Adulthood

00:02:05.800 --> 00:02:09.180
Oh, they are not eating?
Neither Fujio-san nor Fuko-san?

00:02:09.700 --> 00:02:13.380
Fuko said something
about too much snacking.

00:02:13.440 --> 00:02:14.450
As for Fujio...

00:02:14.870 --> 00:02:18.180
Well, there are days when
a girl doesn't feel like eating.

00:02:21.770 --> 00:02:25.880
I'm sorry, Himejima.
There's someone else I'm in love with.

00:02:31.910 --> 00:02:34.000
Of all the girls, why...

00:02:42.070 --> 00:02:43.880
I'm sorry. I...

00:02:44.330 --> 00:02:45.660
Is there someone you like?

00:02:47.290 --> 00:02:49.000
Someone else...

00:02:53.050 --> 00:02:54.150
I'm not sure.

00:02:55.480 --> 00:02:56.320
I see.

00:02:57.760 --> 00:02:59.490
I'll wait until you're sure.

00:03:00.510 --> 00:03:02.540
I don't have to give up entirely, do I?

00:03:05.910 --> 00:03:07.900
Someone I'm in love with...

00:03:16.160 --> 00:03:18.830
Why am I feeling this way?

00:03:21.110 --> 00:03:24.570
This feeling is, well,
how should I name it?

00:03:24.970 --> 00:03:26.060
Concern?

00:03:26.800 --> 00:03:31.040
Yes, as a kyoshi. Kuzuha needs
guidance more than other students.

00:03:40.380 --> 00:03:42.430
Ah, no, no, no, no!

00:03:45.620 --> 00:03:45.660
For
Dog Stew

00:03:48.880 --> 00:03:51.240
This is no good.
I have to cool my head.

00:03:52.090 --> 00:03:56.590
Gochiso

00:03:52.720 --> 00:03:53.930
Come on, Kura-Ge.

00:04:00.240 --> 00:04:02.910
What is it, you're too young
to be hunched over like that.

00:04:02.910 --> 00:04:04.820
Big, big, big news.

00:04:06.340 --> 00:04:09.300
Mori-chan, he says he got fired.

00:04:09.460 --> 00:04:11.210
The biggest blunder of my life...

00:04:11.210 --> 00:04:14.290
taking 10 days too many paid-leave
without even realizing it.

00:04:14.350 --> 00:04:16.340
Well, I'm hardly surprised.

00:04:16.910 --> 00:04:20.800
I liked that company's female uniform
with their micro-mini skirt.

00:04:21.050 --> 00:04:24.460
Cheer up.
There are many companies in Japan.

00:04:24.750 --> 00:04:27.640
I'm sure there are many kinds of
uniforms you haven't seen yet.

00:04:27.640 --> 00:04:28.880
I'll search with you.

00:04:28.980 --> 00:04:30.560
You are going to help me?

00:04:31.220 --> 00:04:32.100
We're friends.

00:04:32.270 --> 00:04:33.070
Kochi-san...

00:04:33.380 --> 00:04:34.980
I've had enough of you two.

00:04:38.280 --> 00:04:40.910
I prefer machines.
They're much less trouble.

00:04:46.240 --> 00:04:48.310
Kuzuha-san, it's almost curfew.

00:04:48.390 --> 00:04:50.660
I'm sorry. I need to run to
the convenience store.

00:04:50.890 --> 00:04:52.660
Be careful, then.

00:04:53.490 --> 00:04:54.200
I will.

00:05:06.060 --> 00:05:08.790
A normal girl would fall
in love with a man.

00:05:12.360 --> 00:05:13.040
Kuzuha...

00:05:19.790 --> 00:05:20.650
Look...

00:05:28.760 --> 00:05:30.810
There's nothing to worry about,
I guess.

00:05:31.230 --> 00:05:36.830
To her, the real me is just a pervert and
the kyoshi-me is a woman just like her.

00:05:37.060 --> 00:05:42.240
I have no right to dislike Bra Man-san.
I'm more twisted than he is.

00:05:48.230 --> 00:05:49.740
Fujio!!

00:05:50.180 --> 00:05:53.910
I thought I'd never catch up with you.
You just kept going all by yourself.

00:05:54.120 --> 00:05:55.150
Oh, sorry.

00:05:56.830 --> 00:05:58.930
Well, it'll take a while.

00:06:00.220 --> 00:06:03.240
You still can't look at Fuko
straight in the face, right?

00:06:03.380 --> 00:06:04.190
No, I'm...

00:06:16.320 --> 00:06:17.100
Good morning!

00:06:19.000 --> 00:06:20.180
Ah, Fujio!!

00:06:24.260 --> 00:06:27.420
Being a strong woman
is a hard thing to do, huh?

00:06:28.410 --> 00:06:32.510
Cheer up. I'll find a better
man than Fukae for you.

00:06:32.930 --> 00:06:35.290
Oh, how about going to
see a love-fortune teller?

00:06:35.470 --> 00:06:37.710
Uozaki and others were all
excited yesterday...

00:06:37.770 --> 00:06:40.060
because they know
a really good one.

00:06:47.860 --> 00:06:53.000
Really, how can you eat when
you just lost a job at your age?

00:06:53.430 --> 00:06:56.240
It's the beginning of
a new life, Ruru-san.

00:06:56.430 --> 00:06:57.410
Right!

00:06:57.600 --> 00:06:57.640
Already
15 Cases
This Month

00:06:57.600 --> 00:06:57.640
RASH
OF
KIDNAPPINGS

00:06:57.810 --> 00:07:00.810
Don't tell me your new
job is being a criminal.

00:07:02.010 --> 00:07:03.410
I wouldn't do that.

00:07:03.740 --> 00:07:04.770
Right!

00:07:07.220 --> 00:07:10.700
So, because of the increased
danger in the area...

00:07:10.700 --> 00:07:13.690
as indicated by these kidnappings,
we need to enact...

00:07:13.690 --> 00:07:17.940
some preventive measures
in order to protect the students.

00:07:19.720 --> 00:07:20.720
Amawa-sensei!

00:07:21.210 --> 00:07:22.100
Are you listening?

00:07:22.220 --> 00:07:23.230
Ah, yes.

00:07:23.640 --> 00:07:27.880
Honestly, such carelessness
is what leads to kidnappings.

00:07:27.980 --> 00:07:29.080
I'm sorry.

00:07:29.290 --> 00:07:33.890
Now, I'd like to share my idea for
a preventative measure.

00:07:34.370 --> 00:07:35.760
OK, attention.

00:07:36.220 --> 00:07:39.420
I assume you already know there's
been many kidnappings recently.

00:07:39.500 --> 00:07:41.020
As a safety measure, you are to...

00:07:41.020 --> 00:07:43.310
come and go from school in groups.

00:07:43.980 --> 00:07:44.980
Tacky!

00:07:45.260 --> 00:07:47.300
We're not elementary school kids.

00:07:55.880 --> 00:07:58.880
Quiet. It'd be too late
after an incident occurs.

00:07:59.550 --> 00:08:02.370
I divided you into groups by area.

00:08:02.760 --> 00:08:05.120
"A Group" those who live
beyond the train station.

00:08:05.810 --> 00:08:09.340
Aoki, Nishinada, Iwaya, and Fukae.

00:08:11.740 --> 00:08:13.590
I'll wait until you're sure.

00:08:14.800 --> 00:08:19.200
Fukae-kun is capable of being
completely honest with his feelings...

00:08:19.600 --> 00:08:19.640
Himejima Kuzuha
.                     Umeda Kasuganomichi

00:08:20.350 --> 00:08:23.000
And B group are those who
live in the girls' dorm.

00:08:23.490 --> 00:08:26.750
Himejima, Kuzuha, Umeda...

00:08:27.500 --> 00:08:30.480
and Kasuganomichi as well.

00:08:32.040 --> 00:08:35.140
Is it possible she knows how I feel?

00:08:36.790 --> 00:08:39.790
Ashiya Ohishi Fukushima

00:08:36.790 --> 00:08:39.790
Himejima Kuzuha
Umeda Kasuganomichi

00:08:44.400 --> 00:08:47.310
Is anything the matter?
You seem depressed.

00:08:48.790 --> 00:08:50.010
Ah, I'm fine.

00:08:50.590 --> 00:08:52.500
This is too much.

00:08:52.500 --> 00:08:54.900
We look like hillbilly students
on a school field trip.

00:08:52.560 --> 00:08:54.900
Note: hillbilly is a person from the backwoods/remote mountain area.

00:08:54.900 --> 00:08:57.610
Besides, we were gonna
go see the fortune teller.

00:08:57.770 --> 00:08:58.930
Right, Fujio?

00:08:59.860 --> 00:09:02.230
It's OK.
I don't really believe in that stuff.

00:09:02.430 --> 00:09:03.610
Yeah, right.

00:09:03.770 --> 00:09:05.630
Stopping on the way home is not right.

00:09:05.950 --> 00:09:09.810
Hey you know what, you are far too dull.

00:09:10.320 --> 00:09:11.930
But a rule is a rule!

00:09:12.060 --> 00:09:13.280
Um, Fujio-chan.

00:09:13.880 --> 00:09:15.940
There's something
I need your advice on.

00:09:20.170 --> 00:09:21.930
Well, nothing. Never mind.

00:09:24.160 --> 00:09:28.030
I can't tell her a thing like this.
She'll despise me.

00:09:29.040 --> 00:09:30.370
What am I going to do?

00:09:31.100 --> 00:09:33.710
OK, let's to set off in droves now.

00:09:58.310 --> 00:10:00.020
Oh sorry, we've started without you.

00:10:00.140 --> 00:10:01.100
Oh, no problem.

00:10:01.800 --> 00:10:04.610
Huh? Is this it for dinner tonight?

00:10:04.860 --> 00:10:06.970
Busy modifying the motorcycle, she says.

00:10:07.440 --> 00:10:11.180
What more can she do on
top of what's already done?

00:10:11.240 --> 00:10:15.810
More importantly, have you heard
anything about nice uniforms recently?

00:10:16.270 --> 00:10:18.250
Ah, using the hidden camera again?

00:10:18.700 --> 00:10:20.910
No, no, for Mori-chan's job-hunting.

00:10:21.270 --> 00:10:23.500
Huh? What's that to do with uniforms?

00:10:23.810 --> 00:10:24.470
Everything.

00:10:25.180 --> 00:10:26.920
Let's try hard again tomorrow.

00:10:27.140 --> 00:10:27.520
Yes.

00:10:29.200 --> 00:10:31.370
Must be nice not having
anything to worry about.

00:10:35.040 --> 00:10:36.660
Good morning.

00:10:36.750 --> 00:10:39.890
Good morning.
Is Kuzuha absent?

00:10:40.160 --> 00:10:44.360
She left early saying she had to
go somewhere before school.

00:10:44.380 --> 00:10:47.090
But that defeats the purpose
of the group system.

00:10:47.420 --> 00:10:50.000
At least she did say she would
be here before classes start.

00:10:50.260 --> 00:10:52.640
Let me know as soon
as she gets here, then.

00:10:52.910 --> 00:10:53.980
I'm a little concerned.

00:11:00.960 --> 00:11:02.590
Hey, is Kuzuha here yet?

00:11:03.780 --> 00:11:04.890
Oh yeah, not yet.

00:11:05.110 --> 00:11:08.130
Not yet?
But first period is already over.

00:11:08.540 --> 00:11:09.570
Sensei!

00:11:10.540 --> 00:11:14.730
I called the dorm, but Fuko-san
isn't back there, either.

00:11:15.110 --> 00:11:15.700
What?

00:11:15.830 --> 00:11:17.070
That's too strange.

00:11:17.340 --> 00:11:18.930
Sensei, could it be?

00:11:38.390 --> 00:11:40.860
Emergency! Emergency! Akira!

00:11:42.200 --> 00:11:43.230
Big news!

00:11:43.370 --> 00:11:44.750
Fuko Kuzuha is missing!!

00:11:44.910 --> 00:11:45.230
What!?

00:11:46.890 --> 00:11:47.770
What do you mean!?

00:11:47.940 --> 00:11:49.030
Just as I said!

00:11:49.440 --> 00:11:51.820
They said she isn't here in school,
or in the dorm.

00:11:52.380 --> 00:11:55.220
Maybe she's been kidnapped.

00:12:01.730 --> 00:12:02.670
Hey, Akira!

00:12:06.320 --> 00:12:07.760
What's all the commotion?

00:12:08.090 --> 00:12:09.020
It's time for class.

00:12:12.980 --> 00:12:14.340
Fukae! Himejima!

00:12:17.400 --> 00:12:18.900
You heard from Aoki and Iwaya.

00:12:19.320 --> 00:12:21.240
I'll go look for her.

00:12:21.500 --> 00:12:24.700
Wait. We're not 100% sure
she's been kidnapped.

00:12:25.100 --> 00:12:29.120
I asked the Principal to
call the police, just in case.

00:12:29.450 --> 00:12:32.980
You guys go back to your class.
I'll go look for her.

00:12:33.580 --> 00:12:34.730
I'm going, too, then.

00:12:34.970 --> 00:12:35.770
Me too.

00:12:36.100 --> 00:12:36.780
But...

00:12:36.820 --> 00:12:40.380
We're wasting time, Sensei.
What if it really is a kidnapping?

00:12:43.950 --> 00:12:46.160
OK, let's split up, then.

00:12:46.690 --> 00:12:49.650
But you two stay together.
OK?

00:12:50.210 --> 00:12:50.740
Yes!

00:12:51.680 --> 00:12:54.180
Please don't let it be a kidnapping.

00:13:24.860 --> 00:13:27.460
Don't be afraid, now.

00:13:41.860 --> 00:13:42.710
This is...

00:13:46.940 --> 00:13:49.380
Kuzuha always carries this around.

00:13:54.680 --> 00:13:55.410
Hello?

00:13:55.650 --> 00:13:57.030
Ba-chan, SOS!

00:13:57.480 --> 00:13:58.220
Fukae!

00:14:01.100 --> 00:14:03.850
They say there's a mini-van
parked near the station...

00:14:03.980 --> 00:14:05.540
that's been stalking only women.

00:14:05.790 --> 00:14:07.550
Maybe they kidnapped...

00:14:08.280 --> 00:14:09.710
Fukae! Wait up!

00:14:10.460 --> 00:14:11.270
Kuzuha!

00:14:13.600 --> 00:14:15.090
Ba-chan, what's taking you so long?

00:14:18.540 --> 00:14:19.300
Ba-chan!

00:14:22.170 --> 00:14:26.180
Bike modification process

00:14:22.170 --> 00:14:26.180
at its climax.

00:14:22.170 --> 00:14:26.180
Sending a deputy...

00:14:26.320 --> 00:14:27.720
Kura-Ge is the deputy?

00:14:28.010 --> 00:14:28.800
Oh man...

00:14:30.710 --> 00:14:34.450
Right, you are not just some meat
reserved for dog stew.

00:14:35.180 --> 00:14:36.400
Smell this.

00:14:41.320 --> 00:14:42.130
Alright!

00:14:43.120 --> 00:14:46.150
Kuzuha... Kuzuha... Kuzuha!

00:14:51.860 --> 00:14:52.450
What is it?

00:14:52.970 --> 00:14:53.650
Look!

00:15:01.140 --> 00:15:03.130
It's about time we started.

00:15:22.460 --> 00:15:23.340
Oh no.

00:15:23.530 --> 00:15:24.330
You're Gochiso's...

00:15:24.970 --> 00:15:25.820
Mori-san?

00:15:25.990 --> 00:15:26.740
Hello.

00:15:28.480 --> 00:15:29.570
Where's Fuko then?

00:15:33.460 --> 00:15:34.160
She's in there?

00:15:44.650 --> 00:15:45.590
Kuzuha!

00:15:46.640 --> 00:15:47.830
Sensei!

00:15:48.230 --> 00:15:49.330
What, who are you?

00:15:49.780 --> 00:15:51.910
So you are the one who
abducted Kuzuha!

00:15:55.860 --> 00:15:57.230
Ouch! Let go!

00:15:57.340 --> 00:15:59.640
Give it up! You kidnapper!

00:16:02.050 --> 00:16:04.230
Kuzuha, everything is OK now.

00:16:04.820 --> 00:16:05.940
You!

00:16:06.930 --> 00:16:10.120
Sensei! No!
He's a fortune teller!

00:16:13.030 --> 00:16:13.070
House of Psychic Reading

00:16:16.330 --> 00:16:17.250
Fortune teller?

00:16:17.740 --> 00:16:18.160
Yes.

00:16:18.290 --> 00:16:20.590
You came here on your own, then?

00:16:21.730 --> 00:16:26.850
Well, I needed some advice...
I didn't mean to be late for school.

00:16:27.570 --> 00:16:30.300
But it took a while to
wake him up, so...

00:16:32.180 --> 00:16:33.340
I'm sorry.

00:16:33.780 --> 00:16:35.630
Oh, I was so worried...

00:16:38.250 --> 00:16:40.570
I was sure you were kidnapped.

00:16:40.800 --> 00:16:41.570
Sensei...

00:16:41.790 --> 00:16:43.050
Oh, I'm so relieved...

00:16:47.320 --> 00:16:49.000
What on earth is going on?

00:16:55.560 --> 00:16:56.380
Fire?

00:17:03.270 --> 00:17:05.170
Damn! Get out, now!

00:17:11.380 --> 00:17:12.460
Sensei!

00:17:25.210 --> 00:17:27.950
Sensei! Sensei! Sensei!

00:17:43.240 --> 00:17:44.320
Kuzuha...

00:17:45.660 --> 00:17:49.340
Kuzuha, you can't carry me.
You go, Kuzuha...

00:17:49.810 --> 00:17:50.710
No, I won't go!

00:17:51.060 --> 00:17:52.020
Don't be stu...

00:17:52.250 --> 00:17:55.510
I won't! I can't go,
leaving you here!

00:17:56.040 --> 00:17:57.970
Kuzuha, why...

00:17:58.380 --> 00:18:01.920
Searching for good-looking uniforms?
Are you stupid?

00:18:02.210 --> 00:18:04.930
But Mori-chan lost his job, so...

00:18:04.930 --> 00:18:06.200
Of course he lost his job!

00:18:07.700 --> 00:18:08.940
Oh, it's Kura-ge.

00:18:12.560 --> 00:18:15.230
Maybe he's trying to tell
us where Fuko-chan is.

00:18:23.940 --> 00:18:24.880
Sensei...

00:18:25.010 --> 00:18:27.120
This time, I will protect you.

00:18:36.520 --> 00:18:38.380
Don't tell me Fuko is in there.

00:18:39.480 --> 00:18:40.870
Because now I know.

00:18:41.580 --> 00:18:45.050
<3

00:18:41.580 --> 00:18:45.050
I don't care if you are a woman,
or what others may think...

00:18:45.640 --> 00:18:47.570
or if you think I'm twisted.

00:18:48.240 --> 00:18:51.060
Even then... Even then, I...

00:18:52.490 --> 00:18:53.800
I love you, Sensei!

00:18:54.900 --> 00:18:56.310
Kuzuha!!

00:18:57.590 --> 00:19:00.070
It's too dangerous!
We have to call the fire department!

00:19:00.070 --> 00:19:01.580
Let me go! There's no time!

00:19:01.690 --> 00:19:03.460
It's impossible! Calm down!

00:19:20.870 --> 00:19:21.530
Out of the way!

00:19:27.470 --> 00:19:28.400
Transformation

00:19:51.830 --> 00:19:52.980
Firing extinguishers!

00:20:02.920 --> 00:20:03.830
There!

00:20:19.870 --> 00:20:24.110
Fuko... Hibiki-sensei...
Thank God.

00:20:41.490 --> 00:20:44.150
The one... Kuzuha's in love with.
It's her?

00:21:11.320 --> 00:21:18.070
At the train station after school
that's where I look for you

00:21:11.320 --> 00:21:18.070
Hokago no eki kimi wo sagasu.

00:21:18.180 --> 00:21:27.430
With my racing heart
can I find you again today?

00:21:18.180 --> 00:21:27.430
Doki doki shiteru
kyo mo aeru kana?

00:21:42.600 --> 00:21:49.390
At this train station
I saw you many times before

00:21:42.600 --> 00:21:49.390
Eki no homu de
mikakete ta kimi.

00:21:49.550 --> 00:21:56.280
But couldn't talk to you
Not at all

00:21:49.550 --> 00:21:56.280
Hajime wa nanimo hanase nakatta.

00:21:56.430 --> 00:22:03.130
Will I find you again tomorrow?

00:21:56.430 --> 00:22:03.130
Moshimo ashita aetara iina?

00:22:03.270 --> 00:22:11.110
Maybe I'll have enough
courage to talk to you

00:22:03.270 --> 00:22:11.110
Youki dashite ieru kamone.

00:22:11.300 --> 00:22:18.240
Even if the sky cries

00:22:11.300 --> 00:22:18.240
Tatoeba sora ga namida shitemo...

00:22:18.240 --> 00:22:27.080
with your smile it's
a sunny day in my eyes

00:22:18.240 --> 00:22:27.080
kimi no egao de hitomi wa hareru yo.

00:22:38.420 --> 00:22:53.440
12th Period "Cleansing Shock of Deception"

00:22:38.630 --> 00:22:39.640
Ah, Mori-san!

00:22:39.660 --> 00:22:42.160
Hi Fukae-kun!
You're about to start homeroom, right?

00:22:42.160 --> 00:22:43.330
Yes. And you?

00:22:43.330 --> 00:22:46.890
We came to visit your homeroom,
but have you seen my friend, Kochi-san?

00:22:46.890 --> 00:22:49.190
Oh, I'll go look.
Kochi-san!

00:22:49.490 --> 00:22:50.310
Yes!

00:22:50.470 --> 00:22:51.540
Mori-san, there he is.

00:22:51.650 --> 00:22:52.840
Bravo!
